# Salt Pan Sprint: the Runoff, track 1 (SPEC 3.2). Flat out across the
# dry cooling lake: long straights on graded brine mud between outflow
# pipes, a C round the pan with a long tongue into its middle. Exhaust
# vents fire across the inner straights and the bottom straight on a
# 4-second timer (20 damage and a sideways shove): read the glow and time
# your run. A coolant slick on the east bend, a service bay lane on the
# west side.
# Control point 0 is the start line; features on point i apply to the
# segment from point i to i+1; a segment without `open` has walls.
league runoff
width 62
# x    y    half   features
 300  140   64                     # start line, heading east
 560  130   64     crates          # top straight: four crates
 800  150   62
 890  260   62     coolant         # a coolant slick on the east bend
 820  390   60
 620  395   60     vent:left       # the tongue, going west: a vent
 440  400   60
 360  490   60
 440  590   60
 640  600   60     vent:right,phase=120  # back east: the second vent, half a cycle on
 820  620   62     crates
 890  760   62
 800  880   64
 560  880   64     vent:left,phase=60    # bottom straight west: the third vent
 330  880   64     crates
 160  860   62
 120  700   62     bay:right       # west side: the service bay lane
 120  420   62
 150  220   64
